  "guide": "Here `Limit` is $A$, `trace` is $\\tau$, and `transportedFlag family i n` is $f_{j,n}$. The source index `i` is the index $j$ used here. The source letter `H` denotes the comparison space called $K$ above. `vectorFunctional σ ξ a` is $\\langle\\xi,\\sigma(a)\\xi\\rangle$. The filter expression asserts that $\\sigma(f_{j,n})\\sigma(b)\\xi$ tends in norm to zero as $n\\to\\infty$, for each fixed $b$; it makes no additional cyclicity assertion.",
